==English==
===Etymology===
[[osteo-]] + [[arthritis]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|osteoarthritides}}

# {{pathology}} A form of [[arthritis]], affecting mainly older people, caused by chronic degeneration of the [[cartilage]] and [[synovial membrane]] of the joints, leading to pain and stiffness.

====Synonyms====
